                     mouse pelle-like kinase). Bacterial member BP26, from
                     Brucella, was shown to assemble into a channel-like
                     structure, while YggE from E. coli has been associated
                     with resistance to oxidative stress.; The SIMPL domain is
                     named for its presence in mouse protein SIMPL (signalling
                     molecule that associates with mouse pelle-like kinase).
                     Bacterial member BP26, from Brucella, was shown to
                     assemble into a channel-like structure, while YggE from E.
                     coli has been associated with resistance to oxidative
                     stress; Derived by automated computational analysis using
                     gene prediction method: Protein Homology."
